  "body": "Beautifully renovated, with superb outdoor living and a sought-after Mairangi Bay address - this is your opportunity to make the move into the Bays!\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a home where all the hard work has already been done. Stylishly renovated throughout, there's a gorgeous modern kitchen, two beautiful bathrooms and light-filled interiors, creating a fresh, contemporary home that's ready to simply move in and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThen step outside to the real showstopper- a super-sized, sun-soaked deck, creating a fantastic extension of the home and made for outdoor entertaining. Fire up the BBQ, invite all your friends and settle in for summer - with this much space and sunshine, you'll want to holiday from home instead.\r\n\r\nOffering three bedrooms, two bathrooms, an enclosed double garage area (recorded by Council as a carport), and loads of off-street parking, there's plenty here to make everyday living easy.\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the sought-after location. If Mairangi Bay is where you want to be, this is your way in. Zoned for Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Rangitoto College, it puts you right where you want to be for the years ahead.\r\n\r\nAt a Glance-\r\n* 3 bedrooms & 2 bathrooms\r\n* Gorgeous modern kitchen with breakfast bar\r\n* Super-sized, sun-soaked entertaining deck\r\n* Light-filled, contemporary interiors\r\n* Double garaging (recorded by Council as a carport) & loads of off-street parking\r\n* Zoned for Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate & Rangitoto College\r\n\r\nThe hard work is done, the Bays lifestyle is waiting - this is your opportunity to make Mairangi Bay home. Act now and make it yours!\r\n\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG35442",
